      "message": "test(app): coarse_laws expects the current STEP facet budget refusal wording\n\ncoarse_laws.rs (#904, merged in #1064) expected the refusal \"re-import\nwith a larger budget\". #1054 (merged in #1074) reworded\nmodel_fidelity::TOO_COARSE to \"re-import with a larger STEP facet\nbudget\" and updated the suites it knew, not this one, so four\ncoarse_laws tests went red on main. The expectation now builds the\ntext from model_fidelity::TOO_COARSE so it cannot drift again. Test\nonly; the product message is unchanged.\n\nFixes #1178",
